lists Norg/Sohyon/onTrigger Norg/Washu/onTrigger Norg/Gimb/onTrigger KorrolokaTunnel/_4t1/onTrigger KorrolokaTunnel/_4t2/onTrigger KorrolokaTunnel/_4t3/onTrigger PortBastok/Kagetora/onTrigger PortBastok/Patient_Wheel/onTrigger PortBastok/Patient_Wheel/onTrade Selbina/Abelard/onTrigger LufaiseMeadows/onZoneIn/1 Rabao/Zoriboh/onTrigger Rabao/onEventFinish/121
